<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n97724" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συγκατα-τίθημι</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>deposit together</i> or <i>at the same time</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμαυτὴν συγκατέθηκα τάφῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Epigr.Gr.</u>
					367
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Cotiaeum</span>), cf. <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				8.157
			</span></i>:—
				Med.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Is.
				6.32
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			
				Med.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. τινὶ τὴν αὐτὴν δόξαν περί
				τινος</span> (where <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δόξαν</span>
			represents <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψῆφον</span>) <i>put down</i>
			the same vote or opinion <i>with</i> another, <i>agree entirely
				with</i> him, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Grg.</u>
				501c
			</span></i>: with dat. only, <i>agree with, assent</i> or <i>conform
				to</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταῖς δόξαις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Epicur.
					<u>Sent. Vat.</u>
					29
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῖς παρακαλουμένοις</span>
			Philipp. ap. <i><span class="en">
				D.
				18.166
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταῖς ἐπιβολαῖς ς. τινί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					3.71.5
				</span></i>
			, etc.: <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. ὅτι . .
			</span><i>agree</i> that . ., <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Top.</u>
				116a11
			</span></i>: abs., <i>assent</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Sphaer.Stoic.
				1.141
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Sign.</u>
				38
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.D.
				<u>Pron.</u>
				49.12
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>BSA</u>
				18.140
			</span></i> (Beroea, <span class="entity">ii A.D.</span>), etc.: later in 
				Act.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-θεῖναι εἴς τι</span>
			<i>agree to</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Porph.
				<u>VP</u>
				61
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Iamb.
				<u>VP</u>
				33.236
			</span></i>: cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συγκατάθεσις</span>.</div>
